<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "The Sounds window has one switch above the event list: notify me on this device even when Retro Hex Chat is closed. With it on, this browser can be woken up after every tab is gone."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_control}>{dgettext("help_features", "What Wakes You")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>{dgettext("help_features", "A private message sent to you")}</li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_features", "Your nickname written in a channel you were in")}</li>
</ul>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Nothing else, ever. Not an ordinary channel line, not a join or a part, and never a bot. A busy room while you were away is one notification, not one per line."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lightbulb}>
  {dgettext("help_features", "Only When Nothing Is Open")}
</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "If you have Retro Hex Chat open anywhere — a chat tab, a call, a Space — nothing is sent. You already have the sound, the flashing title and, if you asked for it, a desktop notification."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lock}>
  {dgettext("help_features", "Per Device, and What Leaves the Server")}
</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "The switch is about this browser on this machine, so turning it off on your laptop leaves your phone alone. What the server sends is encrypted for that one browser: the push service in between — your browser vendor's — carries an address and a block of ciphertext, and can read neither the conversation nor the message."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_server}>{dgettext("help_features", "On Your Own Server")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "This needs a VAPID key pair, and a server without one simply does not have the feature: the switch is not drawn at all rather than drawn and broken."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_features", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="feature-desktop-notifications">
    {dgettext("help_features", "Desktop Notifications")}
  </.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="feature-sounds">{dgettext("help_features", "Sounds")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="feature-mute">{dgettext("help_features", "Mute")}</.help_link>
</p>
